            "heightMul": 200,
            "snippet": "float freq = chf(\"freq\");\n\n\nfloat x = freq * @P.x;\nfloat y = freq * @P.y;\nfloat z = freq * @P.z;\n\nfloat fx = sin(x) * cos(y) + sin(y) * cos(z) + sin(z) * cos(x);\n\nif(fx \u003c 0.01){\n    @density = 0.0;\n} ",
